1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:06,400
Meet R-Pythonizer: a web platform that moves statistical models from R to Python, and proves the result.

2
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:07,731
The rule is simple.

3
00:00:07,731 --> 00:00:09,398
AI writes the Python.

4
00:00:09,398 --> 00:00:10,914
Plain code proves it.

5
00:00:10,914 --> 00:00:12,353
A human approves.

6
00:00:12,353 --> 00:00:17,175
And if a model has no faithful Python equivalent, the platform says so and stops.

